      <activity id="565be2c6-3609-5f23-89fa-a8c1055579c5" activityNameId="7a4ceb8c-9e82-5c24-9ce0-671c33485d76" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Flat plate collector, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Flat plate collector, at plant
The flat plate collector has selective black chrome coating on copper made in the US. ;
UUID: 9c25aa5f-f6a2-3ef7-bdd4-3077de53185d
Production and disposal of a flat plate collector in Switzerland. Including materials, water and energy use of production.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Assembly of a flat plate collector. The collector has a copper sheet coated by black chrome coating.
Time period: Material data have been investigated for a collector produced in 2002. Data for energy uses during production have been investigated for 2001.
Production volume: About 30'000m2 of flat plate collectors were sold in CH in 2001.
Sampling: Questionnaires. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_9c25aa5f-f6a2-3ef7-bdd4-3077de53185d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
